\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 FTS Plugins
\f0\b0\fs24 \
\
The FastTrack Studio effects as CLAP and VST3 plugins: EQ, Comp, Limiter, Gate, Level, Meter, Reverb, Delay, Modulation, Saturate, Pitch, Tune, Unison and Trigger. Each plugin runs natively on Apple silicon and Intel Macs.\
\
Install them for every user of this Mac (into /Library/Audio/Plug-Ins) or for you alone (into your own Library/Audio/Plug-Ins). Choose Customize to pick plugins one by one.\
\
A newer installer replaces the plugins it installed before. Quit your audio host before installing, then rescan plugins.\
